---
// 404 - Proposal Tidak Ditemukan
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Proposal Tidak Ditemukan | Pesat AI</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="doc">
    <header class="doc-header">
      <div class="doc-brand">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="10" fill="#00d4aa"/><text x="50%" y="55%" dominant-baseline="middle" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0a0a2e" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-weight="900" font-size="18">P</text></svg>
        <span class="brand-name">Pesat AI</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="content">
      <div class="badge">404</div>
      <h1>Proposal Tidak Ditemukan</h1>
      <p class="description">
        Tautan proposal yang Anda tuju tidak ditemukan atau sudah tidak aktif. Pastikan URL yang dimasukkan sudah benar atau hubungi konsultan kami.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="https://pesat.app" class="btn btn-primary">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
        <a href="mailto:care@pesat.ai" class="btn btn-secondary">Hubungi Kami</a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="doc-footer">
      <p>Pesat AI &copy; 2026 &mdash; Solusi Pertumbuhan Bisnis Berbasis AI &amp; GEO/SEO</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; color: #111; line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    .doc { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05), 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .doc-header { text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
    .doc-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .brand-name { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
    .content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; background: #fee2e2; color: #dc2626; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0a0a2e; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .description { max-width: 460px; color: #666; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.15s ease; }
    .btn-primary { background: #00d4aa; color: #0a0a2e; border: 1px solid #00d4aa; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #00be98; }
    .btn-secondary { background: #f5f5f5; color: #333; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #eee; }
    .doc-footer { border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding: 1.25rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #999; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { body { background: #fff; } .doc { box-shadow: none; } .content { padding: 3rem 1.25rem; } h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; } }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
